Rips_SetBaseFeePercent
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when the fee is greater than 10000
    │   └── it should revert.
    └── when the fee is valid
        ├── it should update baseFeePercent.
        └── it should emit a {BaseFeePercentUpdated} event.
